@layout Legal.LegalMain
@page "/legal/cookies"

<div class="lg:w-[70%] bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl shadow-amber-900/5 border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-900/30 overflow-hidden relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pattern-bg pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="p-8 lg:p-16 relative z-10 legal-content">
        <section>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-primary mb-12">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 text-primary">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">summarize</span>
                    <span class="font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">TL;DR Summary</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0 font-medium">
                    We love all kinds of cookies! While our physical ones are delicious, our digital ones help
                    us remember what's in your cart and keep our website running smoothly. We use them to
                    improve your experience and never for any "shady jungle business."
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="mt-0">1. What are Digital Cookies?</h2>
            <p>
                Digital cookies are small text files that are placed on your device when you visit Tiger van Cookie.
                They act like a "scent trail," allowing our website to remember your actions and preferences
                over a period of time, so you don't have to keep re-entering them whenever you come back.
            </p>

            <h2>2. How the Pride Uses Cookies</h2>
            <div class="bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 mb-8">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary mb-2 font-bold italic">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">auto_awesome</span>
                    A Better Experience
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0 italic">
                    We use cookies to keep your "Cookie Jar" (shopping cart) full while you browse, to
                    recognize you when you sign in, and to ensure our tiger-themed animations run
                    smoothly on your specific browser.
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2>3. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
            <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
                <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50/30 dark:bg-white/5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/50 dark:border-amber-800/20">
                    <p class="font-bold text-primary mb-1">Essential Cookies</p>
                    <p class="text-sm m-0 italic">Necessary for the site to function. Without these, you couldn't actually buy cookies!</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50/30 dark:bg-white/5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/50 dark:border-amber-800/20">
                    <p class="font-bold text-primary mb-1">Performance Cookies</p>
                    <p class="text-sm m-0 italic">These help us see which cookie flavors are the most popular so we can bake more of them.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2>4. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-primary mb-8">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2 text-primary">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">info</span>
                    <span class="font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest">Partner Note</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm m-0">
                    We may use third-party services like Google Analytics to understand our jungle traffic.
                    These partners may set their own cookies to help us improve our service.
                </p>
            </div>

            <h2>5. Managing Your Crumbs</h2>
            <p>
                You can control and/or delete cookies as you wish. You can delete all cookies that are
                already on your computer and you can set most browsers to prevent them from being placed.
                However, if you do this, you may have to manually adjust some preferences every time
                you visit, and some services (like your saved cart) may not work.
            </p>

            <h2>6. Privacy Connection</h2>
            <p>
                Our use of digital cookies is closely tied to our <strong>Privacy Policy</strong>. We recommend
                reading both to fully understand how the Tiger van Cookie pride protects your data.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-amber-100 dark:border-amber-800/30 text-center">
                <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest opacity-50">End of Cookie Policy</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>